    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VRM Dance Dream MV</strong> is a sophisticated music video creation tool designed specifically for VRM avatars. Create commercially usable videos with ease by freely combining avatars, dances, music, stages, and effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bWhen importing and using data, please be sure to check the terms and conditions of the data's creator ordistributor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfect for users who:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to create professional-quality MVs in a short time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wish to effortlessly make models posted on VRoid Hub or other VRM models dance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to check model movement integrity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find MMD operations challenging</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Setup!</strong> Create your unique MV by simply selecting five elements: avatar, dance, music, stage, and effects! Let the tool handle all the complex camera work for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Model Data</strong>: VRM and VRoid Hub compatible (VRM1.0 supported)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Motion Data</strong>: Compatible with BVH, FBX, VMD, VRMA</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music Data</strong>: Supports MP3 and WAV formats  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage Data</strong>: Supports GLB format  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Features</strong>: Automatic camera work, post-effects, MP4 video export</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique MVs with endless combinations! Start your creative journey now!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VRM Dance Dream MV</strong> is a sophisticated music video creation tool designed specifically for VRM avatars. Create commercially usable videos with ease by freely combining avatars, dances, music, stages, and effects!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bWhen importing and using data, please be sure to check the terms and conditions of the data's creator ordistributor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Perfect for users who:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to create professional-quality MVs in a short time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wish to effortlessly make models posted on VRoid Hub or other VRM models dance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to check model movement integrity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find MMD operations challenging</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy Setup!</strong> Create your unique MV by simply selecting five elements: avatar, dance, music, stage, and effects! Let the tool handle all the complex camera work for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Model Data</strong>: VRM and VRoid Hub compatible (VRM1.0 supported)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Motion Data</strong>: Compatible with BVH, FBX, VMD, VRMA</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music Data</strong>: Supports MP3 and WAV formats  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stage Data</strong>: Supports GLB format  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Features</strong>: Automatic camera work, post-effects, MP4 video export</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique MVs with endless combinations! Start your creative journey now!</p>",
    "short_description": "VRM Dance Dream MV lets you easily create pro-quality dance MVs. Just mix avatars, dances, music, stages, and effects! Supports models posted on VRoid Hub, plus VRM, BVH, FBX, and VMD formats. Auto camera work and effects make creation fast and stunning!",
